From 9304b977701d0be7c0c41b43a6cbcf92a113bf35 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gili Tzabari <cowwoc2020@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 16:30:32 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Update rustls-webpki and webpki roots to reject distrusted
 emSign intermediates

Select rustls-webpki 0.103.16 and webpki-roots and webpki-root-certs 1.0.10 for
RUSTSEC-2026-0381, RUSTSEC-2026-0382 and RUSTSEC-2026-0383 without disabling
advisory checks.

The hosted cargo-deny check fails with all three vulnerabilities on rustls-webpki
0.103.15 and the 1.0.5 root bundles. With the updated releases, cargo-deny 0.20.2
with the CI arguments exits 0. The existing duplicate-version warnings remain
visible.
---
 MODULE.bazel.lock   |  6 +++---
 codex-rs/Cargo.lock | 12 ++++++------
 2 files changed, 9 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

